  "abstract": "Monolithic AMR Agent Kit rollup for end-to-end Redis and Azure Managed Redis guidance. Combines all 76 current rules from redis-best-practices, redis-ai-patterns, and azure-infra into one generated skill covering Redis application patterns, Redis AI/vector/RAG workloads, and Azure Managed Redis infrastructure and operations. Rule content is sourced from the focused skills instead of copied, with a generated manifest documenting the deterministic rollup inputs.",
